[{"sha":"e7363f1027d5ea391500359bc1a2b17cb9d8d66f","node_id":"C_kwDOAVrxtdoAKGU3MzYzZjEwMjdkNWVhMzkxNTAwMzU5YmMxYTJiMTdjYjlkOGQ2NmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"KR Ravindra","email":"rajaravindra919@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-07T13:51:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-07T13:51:52Z"},"message":"Add const reference service callback signatures (#3269)\n\nAnyServiceCallback now also accepts\n  void (const Request &, Response &)\n  void (const rmw_request_id_t &, const Request &, Response &)\nin addition to the existing shared_ptr signatures. The request and\nresponse are still received as shared_ptr internally and are\ndereferenced before calling the user callback, mirroring what\nAnySubscriptionCallback does for const MessageT & callbacks.\ndispatch() throws std::runtime_error instead of dereferencing a null\nrequest or request header for these two alternatives.\n\nBoth set() overloads gain matching function_traits::same_arguments\nbranches so std::bind results resolve to the right alternative, and\ndispatch() handles the two new alternatives. Existing overloads are\nunchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: KR Ravindra <42912207+KR-Ravindra@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8586a4c9e7b82fee044d4c0e5bf38829a457645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/git/trees/f8586a4c9e7b82fee044d4c0e5bf38829a457645"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/git/commits/e7363f1027d5ea391500359bc1a2b17cb9d8d66f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxk54CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHwwQAGQzwbcglDM3gQTThYmx0EQ3\nGEVk2NlpOqVwLrp+pJOXEWx6/I6yP3jtgN0hY1RYKe9NDero65rfmybq90T87YjU\nMPo8AjArrdz8lyclWvIuaQnUFtRFkkPmfxTr8bLr6IztEgNi6eroRAoVeEI/OrmT\neaC/AC7WvnRjZHOVciyKXqraCchkMj5ZInst5S4sXZdIcveqFeipJ9PtjpjW0MTf\nCiDkm34UMCad9QHpDb0ah5AsqCBE31Is9J4LIH9ygcB5fXb4zVVHJSxhQBmBfOct\n2qDwg3Jr1RchX1XqLjtxwbxKVfLAlKEMCfZ2R5L//ju1qsVwiZ9eJx8TidT1DmHt\no8WUzbOql0Lg7tMmwU1gZo3itVLrNUxpwviJJzGc+IA0TznWcQz6MRsh81YAS3mM\n2EjqIqAS5aUFbg7OPzRS0krIpsHSYcyEUfNhbOwDCASGEqCioEovmYsQX5+/mvBe\nKmmP+RFFU6VAy6eetNKREHsQcDPab996iGhAbnCqmDXrr0iDFXfJNUQMUNw/Gmpy\nkCvXu4rO6CjfDGPcqiSaQwhApe8cHbLscXs/dgGp0TW4oVmFCyByd2jJGh8psuRD\n1uWmir3P7GxyVlKmhdIvHjnH/f8fAb/YGJulxQIyMAVJwzJIZR2FRj9utq4r2mPu\nkrqngg7cpJeHJEfvze25\n=Z0bQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f8586a4c9e7b82fee044d4c0e5bf38829a457645\nparent 17850ea608637ce210afba1db6ec1dc3c716c6ba\nauthor KR Ravindra <rajaravindra919@gmail.com> 1791381112 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791381112 +0200\n\nAdd const reference service callback signatures (#3269)\n\nAnyServiceCallback now also accepts\n  void (const Request &, Response &)\n  void (const rmw_request_id_t &, const Request &, Response &)\nin addition to the existing shared_ptr signatures. The request and\nresponse are still received as shared_ptr internally and are\ndereferenced before calling the user callback, mirroring what\nAnySubscriptionCallback does for const MessageT & callbacks.\ndispatch() throws std::runtime_error instead of dereferencing a null\nrequest or request header for these two alternatives.\n\nBoth set() overloads gain matching function_traits::same_arguments\nbranches so std::bind results resolve to the right alternative, and\ndispatch() handles the two new alternatives. Existing overloads are\nunchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: KR Ravindra <42912207+KR-Ravindra@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-10-07T13:51:53Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/commits/e7363f1027d5ea391500359bc1a2b17cb9d8d66f","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/commit/e7363f1027d5ea391500359bc1a2b17cb9d8d66f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/commits/e7363f1027d5ea391500359bc1a2b17cb9d8d66f/comments","author":{"login":"KR-Ravindra","id":42912207,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTEyMjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42912207?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"ht