El2itRBC+\nAUfTBcohbrW/dBwsOHr3\n=Sqi+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 870d6c811ea2470ad843c3d98e94e18cf78ec5dc\nparent 6c66f377e4f623296c57f96fe5478874b8d1ac21\nauthor Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp> 1791359850 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791359850 +0200\n\nRemove libstatistics_collector from rclcpp QUALITY_DECLARATION (#3316)\n\nTopic statistics were removed in #3203, which dropped the\nlibstatistics_collector and statistics_msgs dependencies from\npackage.xml and CMakeLists.txt. The statistics_msgs section of the\nquality declaration was removed at the same time, but the\nlibstatistics_collector section was left behind. Remove it so the\ndeclared runtime dependencies match the actual ones.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-10-07T07:57:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/commits/17850ea608637ce210afba1db6ec1dc3c716c6ba","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/commit/17850ea608637ce210afba1db6ec1dc3c716c6ba","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/commits/17850ea608637ce210afba1db6ec1dc3c716c6ba/comments","author":{"login":"fujitatomoya","id":43395114,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMzk1MTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43395114?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya","html_url":"https://github.com/fujitatomoya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/repos","events_url":