clcpp_INCLUDE_DIRS\nvariable to give cppcheck include hints. Take the include directories from the\nrclcpp::rclcpp target instead so the hint keeps working.\n\nFixes ros2/rclcpp#3285\n\nSigned-off-by: Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfb068626b2efea8eeded51097b1facbc5d91643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/git/trees/cfb068626b2efea8eeded51097b1facbc5d91643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rclcpp/git/commits/6c66f377e4f623296c57f96fe5478874b8d1ac21","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxKwlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASq4QAA2NzgChSO2RC7lnoMm+YJ9D\nsLeNJXhlL3aZDoQU/M2TUnrkeADpvEoBr2VzPYA6z5UvxcadJhQ6pqcuD/Fvqzss\nE4lRLGXsp2DKJeFrSq1yALDPPUn+CD5GcTNlbFGO4OGHe3TLlk8hp2S5x8B5xs5S\nGNmODSO8Mt79QSYGNMCaFAJ1v+hYH27yGskz1DtBR5NQ2wSNHRUYxe37AjRY9Q7P\npWoQcGlUfBWuiaw35CNoj2PhITb9CK5uYZCwo+l3jhHl06zevyH5EiGcsWKnosW6\nutqCbSoGcNnAlGqg0fpqgRn0NdGL2foUq8rY7tdPhf2jjZc6N3/PFd7p2WASz3gb\nrmE02wJliS4kppwV39y+4nHFkUC9SGzo/DoSGy3866aQGkKV24S4BLYz5btAmlBI\nzWmfbYlntZZNuI/gYmdTRRYYaW4e0Z1rQKSjLnST+nQNgBbiKGo0GTqz7rpIr+Js\na/FI46NUsITdgP53lDhV7YWj5ySbq0GGPhtBN2VsAQfUSI42mAvFnwNT9J7JnaYa\nBfNAMzVT0vo1V/uJ2yUzbyZt93VHAdL8ShbTPc1gdIgMUK6k6PPSy4TSxmvpwVVZ\nl24EFM5fR6ge3eGIk5xZRZvqGJRBF+SEgUDS5/8XSWHsIA5U9UIhDIZ6xuQDLq8d\nY9j6W3uEOd2U6ZaA0Btl\n=TQyF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cfb068626b2efea8eeded51097b1facbc5d91643\nparent afe12bfa3777f482f96bb979ed37ade21a7feb0f\nauthor Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp> 1791274020 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791274020 +0200\n\nRemove ament_export_include_directories and ament_export_libraries calls (#3305)\n\nThese packages already call ament_export_targets(), so the old-style CMake variable exports are redundant.\n\nrclcpp_action and rclcpp_lifecycle relied on the old-style rclcpp_INCLUDE_DIRS\nvariable to give cppcheck inclu